#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-AD0817 expect=noViolation domain=ADLBC
# Rule:Description: Within a dataset, there is more than one value of SUBJIDN for a given value of SUBJID, considering only those rows on which both variables are populated.
# Declared-tier scope: structure= states the ADaM data structure this minimal table stands for;
# #define is its mandatory carrier (ScenarioDeclaredScopeProvider.install).
#define standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADLBC structure=BDS
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col SUBJIDN type=Char
col SUBJID type=Char
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | 1015 | 701-1015
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1023 | 1023 | 701-1023
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | 1015 | 701-1015
---
